      "summaries": {
        "en": "DeepEP is a communication library designed for expert-parallel training and inference in Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) models, solving the high communication overhead of routing tokens across experts. Its key innovation is a low-latency, high-throughput all-to-all communication primitive optimized for GPU clusters, leveraging CUDA and RDMA for efficient data transfer. You can integrate DeepEP into your MoE training pipeline to reduce idle time and scale to more experts, or use it for inference to accelerate token dispatch and combine operations.",
        "zh": "DeepEP 是专为混合专家模型（MoE）设计的专家并行通信库，旨在降低专家间路由 token 的高通信开销。其核心创新在于基于 CUDA 和 RDMA 的低延迟、高吞吐全交换通信原语，针对 GPU 集群优化。集成后，可显著减少专家间空闲等待时间，支持更多专家扩展；推理阶段加速 token 分发与合并。该库为大规模 MoE 系统提供开箱即用的高性能通信方案，使开发者更专注于模型设计。",
        "es": "DeepEP is a communication library designed for expert-parallel training and inference in Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) models, solving the high communication overhead of routing tokens across experts. Its key innovation is a low-latency, high-throughput all-to-all communication primitive optimized for GPU clusters, leveraging CUDA and RDMA for efficient data transfer. You can integrate DeepEP into your MoE training pipeline to reduce idle time and scale to more experts, or use it for inference to accelerate token dispatch and combine operations.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "DeepEP gives teams a dependable path to production-ready AI tooling.",
          "what": "DeepEP is a communication library designed for expert-parallel training and inference in Mixture-of-Experts (MoE) models, solving the high communication overhead of routing tokens across experts. Its key innovation is a low-latency, high-throughput all-to-all communication primitive optimized for GPU clusters, leveraging CUDA and RDMA for efficient data transfer. You can integrate DeepEP into your MoE training pipeline to reduce idle time and scale to more experts, or use it for inference to accelerate token dispatch and combine operations.",
          "how": "Review https://github.com/deepseek-ai/DeepEP for docs, run starter examples, and integrate with your pipeline or evaluation stack."
        }
      },
