      "summaries": {
        "en": "Gemma-4-E2B-it is Google's open-source any-to-any multimodal model that processes and generates text, images, and code within a single framework. Its key innovation is the 'E2B' (End-to-End Bidirectional) architecture, enabling seamless cross-modal understanding without separate encoders. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like visual question answering, image captioning, or code generation from mixed inputs. Try it with the provided inference script to build multimodal chatbots or automated documentation tools.",
        "zh": "Gemma-4-E2B-it是谷歌开源的任意模态输入输出模型，能同时处理文本、图像和代码。其核心技术是E2B（端到端双向）架构，通过统一注意力机制实现跨模态的深度理解，无需传统分离式编码器。你可以在Hugging Face上直接调用Transformers库加载模型，用于视觉问答、图像描述生成或根据混合输入编写代码等场景。尝试用官方推理脚本快速搭建多模态聊天机器人或自动化文档工具，体验真正的any-to-any能力。",
        "es": "Gemma-4-E2B-it is Google's open-source any-to-any multimodal model that processes and generates text, images, and code within a single framework. Its key innovation is the 'E2B' (End-to-End Bidirectional) architecture, enabling seamless cross-modal understanding without separate encoders. You can deploy it via Hugging Face Transformers for tasks like visual question answering, image captioning, or code generation from mixed inputs. Try it with the provided inference script to build multimodal chatbots or automated documentation tools.",
        "sections": {
          "why": "gemma-4-E2B-it stands out for transformers, safetensors, and gemma4 in real-world workflows.",
